  "description": "Jeon Du-In’s relationship with Baek Ryong is complicated. He gets paid by Ryong to do dirty jobs, which is standard fare for a thug like him. The fact that they have sex together doesn’t make things that messy, either. The part where everything gets complicated is the fact that Du-In doesn’t really want any kind of relationship with Ryong in the first place. Du-In isn’t the type of man to be domesticated, and Ryong likes him that way…But he doesn’t want to let his “beast” go, either. A savagely captivating prequel to “Dispar”.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Gosuwi Danpyeonseon (고수위 단편선) Collection.*",
